      "id": "try-load",
      "name": "TryLoad",
      "category": "SoftObjectPath",
      "signature": "TryLoad(Target, In Load Context)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "FSoftObjectPath*"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Load Context",
          "type": "FUObjectSerializeContext*",
          "default": "nullptr"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "UObject*",
      "docs": "Attempts to load the asset, this will call LoadObject which can be very slow\n@param InLoadContext Optional load context when called from nested load callstack\n@return Loaded UObject, or nullptr if the reference is null or the asset fails to load"
    },
    {
      "id": "load-async",
      "name": "LoadAsync",
      "category": "SoftObjectPath",
      "signature": "LoadAsync(Target, In Completion Delegate, In Optional Params)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "FSoftObjectPath*"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Completion Delegate",
          "type": "FLoadSoftObjectPathAsyncDelegate"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Optional Params",
          "type": "FLoadAssetAsyncOptionalParams",
          "default": "FLoadAssetAsyncOptionalParams()"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Int",
      "docs": "Attempts to asynchronously load the object referenced by this path.\nThis will call LoadAssetAsync to load the top level asset and resolve the sub paths before calling the delegate.\nFStreamableManager can be used for more control over callback timing and garbage collection.\n@param\tInCompletionDelegate\tDelegate to be invoked when the async load finishes, this will execute on the game thread as soon as the load succeeds or fails\n@param\tInOptionalParams\t\tOptional parameters for async loading the asset\n@return Unique ID associated with this load request (the same object or package can be associated with multiple IDs)."
    },
